  <book code="GAL" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:33:41 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Galatians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thơ Ga-la-ti</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ga-la-ti</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt">Ga-la-ti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Phaau-lô, mưi sưưq-đô — kah bhral tââq akóón manưih kung kah tââq mưi nak ngaai lââng, bơơi tââq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih lơq tââq Yaang Pleng Ama, Yaang ơi payuur Ađó mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt — <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />palơq tabhơt nôôq adhi anó tơơt palơq aku, pagơơi nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq dhiq Ga-la-ti. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Rââm phươk liêm tơk leq adhi anó palơq lơq yươq rau ha tââq Yaang Pleng nek Ama, lơq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq nôôq he. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Yaang ơi jaau ađêi taai matu lơt nôôq he, đóng Ađó ve chóóm trôông paq nôôq he lơh tââq klaang đơơi têêng aak xók ađôk, ting karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng, Ama nôôq he. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Rââm cha-iil tabah chô leq Ađó đóng patơk nh'chró taluôn luôn. A-meen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Aku hêq lêi xók adhi anó kuôq tahươk palâh lơh tââq Yaang ơi dhaloong ađêi tââq phươk liêm ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih đóng ting mưi Taruuih liêm lââng, <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />hơq Taruuih Liêm nek kah chóóm lalei ơi, chapiên nek tââq nôôq manưih tôôh nek nôôq manưih têêng panhok adhi anó lơq kiêng dhơ palơt Taruuih Liêm ưng Chuôq Paq manưih. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Bơơi dhơ đóng palơq nôôq yi, môôiq mưi dhơn Chuôq tââq pleng, truuih đóng adhi anó mưi taruuih liêm n'tua palơq taruuih liêm hơq nôôq yi ơi truuih đóng adhi anó, nek manưih ađek phaai bâân tóh karuuh. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Kơi nôôq yi ơi đóók móón loom hei, lơq xók ađôk aku móón majal dyơq: “La ngaai ađek truuih đuui đóng adhi anó mưi taruuih liêm lalei palơq taruuih liêm hơq adhi anó ơi đơơp xâng, nek manưih ađek phaai bâân tóh karuuh.” <verse eid="GAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Taai xók ađôk, aku dyơq têêng iêm lóóm akóón manưih môôiq nek Yaang Pleng? Hamôôiq ve kơq aku tabâân kơi têêng iêm lóóm akóón manưih, la aku biêh dyơq têêng iêm lóóm akóón manưih, nek alua aku eh rau nek dhơn ratơơq ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Nhan móón adhi anó, aku nhan pakah đóng adhi anó n'nal leq Taruuih Liêm ơi bâân aku truuih đuui kơi Taruuih Liêm achêk eh rau nek ting tađuui mưi ngaai lââng. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Taai aku ơi kah pei đơơp Taruuih Liêm achêk tââq manak manâ, aku kung kah bâân pachóóm đóng, bơơi ađek nek tââq rau tapakah ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="GAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Tââq adhi anó ơi xâng leq kơi mamông bhêêl n'loom ưng aku kalóóng taruuih Jo Thaaiq, ađek nek aku biêh kóóp janah kuôq dhaang akóón dhơn Chuôq ưng Yaang Pleng, lơq bhiêk tabâân leng kaxiêt kabhuh achêk. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Lơq aku tahayuur kalóóng taruuih Jo Thaaiq jalơh bơk ngaai mađó bhayuur m'pơng dhanuôr aku, xók val kơi tabhlơng pajêi leq nôôq taruuih takóh ưng abhươp ama ađêi. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Bơơi xók Yaang Pleng, Yaang ơi lơơi pantua aku tââq kalóóng luônh amêêq ađêi, lơq ơi dhaloong aku tââq phươk liêm Ađó, bhuui lóóm <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />tapakah Akóón Ađó kalóóng aku, đóng aku ve chóóm truuih pachóóm leq Akóón achêk dhiq m'pơng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, nek n'drươh ađek aku kah xêi palơq bech lơq ahaam. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Aku kung kah bhađơk vôôiq tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem đóng lum nôôq manưih têêng sưưq-đô laloom aku. Klóóih dhiq ađek, aku ơi vôôiq tơk A-ra-bi, hayơq val palâh chô dhiq Đa-met.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Xong ađek, lơh pe kamó, aku đơk vôôiq tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem đóng têêng keen palơq Sê-pha lơq tơơt lóóiq palơq ađó ađek majêt xââng tangêi. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Bơơi aku ơi kah lum mưi nak ngaai lââng kalóóng nôôq sưưq-đô, lơh tââq Ja-kơ, adhi padruuih ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Leq nôôq rau aku xaraq đóng adhi anó, phaai lêi nô ađô, toom mat Yaang Pleng, aku kah praaq chachââr. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Xong ađek, aku vôôiq tơk nôôq charhóóng ưng Si-ri lơq Si-li-si. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Xók achêk aku biêh kah bâân nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih dhiq Ju-đê n'nal mat. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Bơơi nôôq akóón dhơn chuôq biêh chapiên xâng kơi ađô: “Ađó n'loom hei kóóp janah nôôq he ađôk dyơq truuih đuui lóóm huuiq hơq ađó achêk đóók tabâân leng kaxiêt.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Hayơq piđó bhi haanh Yaang Pleng ơi taai aku.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Lơh bhluuch majêt puôn kamó, aku yuur vôôiq lóóiq tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem palơq Ba-na-ba, kung xók đââng Tiit ting vôôiq. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Xók achêk, ting rau tapakah, aku ơi yuur vôôiq lơq truuih pakah toom piđó Taruuih Liêm hơq aku truuih đuui bhlưa kalóóng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, bơơi ting kơi n'tua kala palơq nôôq manưih ve têêng gamak, kapơn e kơi kiq ađek hơq ađêi dyơq mut hamôôiq ơi mut kalóóng kah machak maraang. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Dhơ kơi ađek, chênh kơi Tiit, manưih ting vôôiq palơq aku, nek manưih Hi-laap, kung kah bâân par-eep phaai đơơp iêt ng'kar. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Hơq chiên achêk nek tââq nôôq adhi anó têêng palơt kadrêi palââp, nek nôôq manưih ơi karluk mót đóng ting choop rau rathaai ưng nôôq yi, nek rathaai hơq nôôq yi ve kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, hơq đóng piđó ve chóóm kóóp nôôq yi têêng xól. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Hơq nôôq yi kung ơi kah pakah rau parngau toom piđó kalóóng maxưưiq maxâ, đóng paraaq dhalam ưng Taruuih Liêm ve chóóm chaq ching palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="GAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Dyơq leq phơn nôôq manưih đơơp thê nek têêng gamak ađek tôôh (dhơ n'loom hei piđó ve nek têêng mak n'đó, nek kah đuôh têêng n'tua ting kơi palơq aku; Yaang Pleng kah chamet lêi hót nguôi ưng akóón manưih) alua, nôôq manưih đơơp lêi bhi chap ađek kah trul paxóng hau rauriq đóng aku marau marâ. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Bơơi palâh lóóiq, xók đơơp n'nal kơi aku ơi bâân huuiq pajaau tarnêêng truuih đuui Taruuih Liêm koom đóng manưih kah đơơp iêt ng'kar, thê kơi Phi-e-rơ nek koom đóng manưih đơơp iêt ng'kar <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />(Taai, Yaang praaq têêng kalóóng Phi-e-rơ đóng têêng tarnêêng sưưq-đô chamet tơk manưih đơơp iêt ng'kar, kung praaq têêng kalóóng aku kanóq tơk manưih katiêk lââng), <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />lơq xong xók bâân n'nal phươk liêm ơi bâân đóng leq aku, hơq Ja-kơ, Sê-pha, lơq Jang, nôôq manưih thê kơi nek nôôq tanól, ơi pađơơp têi atươm makơi palơq Ba-na-ba lơq aku, đóng nôôq yi nek kanóq tơk nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, dyơq piđó kanóq leq nôôq manưih đơơp iêt ng'kar, <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />chapiên pató kơi ađô nôôq yi kiêng hei tơk manưih ngeeo, chênh nek rau hơq aku kung ơi pajêi têêng.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Bơơi xók Sê-pha vôôiq tơk An-ti-ôôt nek aku ơi jaklâk jơl n'drươh toom mat ađó taai ađó biêh đaang chóóm teng jươm. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Taai laloom xók nôôq manưih tââq Ja-kơ bhral, ađó biêh cha madhiq palơq nôôq manưih katiêk lââng. Bơơi xók piđó bhral, ađó ơi róch lơh lơq blah ađêi n'tua, taai kapơn nôôq manưih mađó kabhuh panhuh đơơp pheep iêt ng'kar. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Lơq nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq dyơq lóóiq kung ting kabhuh galơơk chachââr ting ađó, patơk mơ chênh nek Ba-na-ba kung bâân tapaxuq ting tađuui lóóm chachââr galơơk ưng piđó. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Bơơi xók aku lêi kơi piđó dyơq kah praaq têêng pâng tapat ting paraaq dhalam ưng Taruuih Liêm, aku ơi praaq palơq Sê-pha toom mat dyóp ngaai: “La amei, nek manưih Jo Thaaiq, mamông kơi manưih katiêk lââng hơq eh kơi manưih Jo Thaaiq, nek hau kơi amei ve đuôh pa-eep manưih katiêk lââng phaai mamông thê manưih Jo Thaaiq?” <verse eid="GAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Nôôq yi nek manưih Jo Thaaiq tââq xók n'niên, hơq eh rau manưih matu lơt gluh tââq manưih katiêk lââng. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Bơơi taai n'nal kơi kah mưi ngaai bâân đóók bhơt liêm ganơơm tarnêêng têêng ting kơi gani, lơh tââq nek ve lóóm huuiq dhiq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, hơq nôôq yi ơi tabóq lóóm huuiq dhiq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih đóng nôôq yi bâân đóók bhơt liêm chênh ve lóóm huuiq dhiq Chuôq Paq Manưih hơq eh rau đươi tarnêêng têêng ting kơi gani. Taai dyóp ng'kar m'bech e kah bâân đóók bhơt liêm tââq tarnêêng têêng ting gani. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Bơơi la, dyơq xók chik-chêk kơi bâân đóók bhơt liêm kalóóng Chuôq Paq Mưih, chênh nôôq yi kung bâân chamet lêi nek manưih ve matu, hơq ve kơq Chuôq Paq Manưih nek manưih têêng yaauq đóng matu lơt? Rau ađek nek kah mơ chóóm ve! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ơi la aku kadhơng lóóiq nôôq rau hơq ađêi ơi rơh pahư, nek aku lalua ađêi nek manưih têêng lơt gani. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Tââq pakah gani aku ơi chêt ting kơi palơq gani, đóng aku ve chóóm mamông đóng Yaang Pleng. Aku ơi bâân tateeng dhiq m'baang chatông lơq Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />dhơ aku kah ve mamông dyơq, bơơi Chuôq Paq Manưih mamông kalóóng aku. Dyơq gral đơơi hơq aku xók ađôk dyơq mamông kalóóng ng'kar m'bech, nek aku mamông kalóóng lóóm huuiq, dhiq Akóón Yaang Pleng, Yaang ơi nh'nhơr aku lơq pajaau chênh mưi Ađó klóóih đóng aku. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Aku kah ve kajêêq lơơi phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, ơi la rau bhơt liêm nek tââq gani kơi achêk nek Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi chêt kơi kah malơơi!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Ơ, Nôôq manưih Ga-la-ti parngôôk! Ngaai ơi pagun adhi anó, xók hơq toom mat adhi anó, Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih đơơp teeng đinh dhiq m'baang chatông ơi bâân truuih đuui kơi drêh dróói? <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Aku chapiên kiêng tabâân n'nal rau ađô tââq adhi anó: Adhi anó ơi bâân đơơp Yaang Liêm tââq tarnêêng têêng kơi gani môôiq tââq rau ting xâng kalóóng lóóm huuiq? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Adhi anó parngôôk kơi ađek alua? Xók ơi tââp tanââp palơq Yaang Liêm, kah alua xók ađôk adhi anó ơi paxong palơq achak araang? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Kah alua adhi anó ơi đơơp n'nal mơ hadhaap janah đóng kah bâân rauriq? — la alua kơi ađek nek alua kah malơơi malaai! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Kơi ađek, Yaang đóng Yaang Liêm leq adhi anó lơq têêng nôôq tarnêêng mataai raman dhiq m'pơng adhi anó, achêk nek tââq tarnêêng têêng ting gani, môôiq tââq rau ting xâng kalóóng lóóm huuiq? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Kơi Ap-ra-haam “huuiq ganơơm Yaang Pleng lơq ađek nek rau đóng ađó bâân đóók nek bhơt liêm,” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />kơi ađek nek, phaai n'nal kơi, ngaai dhơơm ve lóóm huuiq, ađek nek akóón ưng Ap-ra-haam. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Bơơi xók loom lêi kơi Yaang Pleng đóók manưih katiêk lââng nek bhơt liêm tââq lóóm huuiq, nek bha-aar Yaang Pleng ơi truuih pachóóm Taruuih Liêm laloom đóng Ap-ra-haam kơi ađô: “Dyóp dhanuôr e bâân phươk dhiq akóón.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Đóng hayơq, ngaai ve lóóm huuiq nek bâân phươk kung palơq Ap-ra-haam, ađó ve lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="GAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />N'nal mơ manưih ganơơm dhiq tarnêêng têêng ting gani nek tơơt raal paraaq tóh karuuh; taai ve xaraq kơi ađô: “Đaang tóh karuuh dyóp ngaai kah mưng lóóm palơq dyóp rau bâân xaraq kalóóng bha-aar gani đóng têêng piđó.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Bơơi drêh dróói kơi kah ngaai ganơơm gani bâân đóók bhơt liêm toom mat Yaang Pleng, taai “manưih bhơt liêm e mamông tââq lóóm huuiq,” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Dyơq gani nek kah gluh tââq lóóm huuiq, bơơi, “Manưih têêng nôôq tarnêêng ưng gani e mamông ganơơm piđó.” <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi pók nôôq he lơh tââq rau tóh karuuh ưng gani xók đơơp tóh karuuh klóóih đóng nôôq he, taai ve paraaq xaraq: “Đaang tóh karuuh ngaai nak bâân tayông dhiq n'lóóng chatông” — <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />đóng phươk liêm ưng Ap-ra-haam tơk leq manưih katiêk lââng kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, buôn đóng nôôq he ve chóóm bâân đơơp paraaq hươq leq Yaang Liêm ganơơm lóóm huuiq.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Nhan móón adhi anó, aku praaq ting kơi akóón manưih. Dhơ kah n'nal kơi, kah ngaai ve chóóm rơh tabil ha môôiq trul tamót raket bóóp ơi bâân akóón manưih tavaaih. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Mat lââng, nôôq paraaq hươq nek ơi bâân praaq palơq Ap-ra-haam lơq đóng akóón chachau ưng ađó. Paraaq achêk kah praaq “lơq đóng nôôq akóón chachau” kơi chaleq tơk bơk ngaai, bơơi nek “lơq đóng akóón chachau ưng akóón” kơi chaleq tơk mưi nak, hơq ađek nek Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Bơơi leq rau aku kiêng praaq ađek nek: Xók vaaih bhral lơh puôn hariêng pe jêt kamó, gani kah rơh tabil raket bóóp ơi bâân Yaang Pleng tavaaih laloom hei dhalam kah baq tiêng paraaq hươq. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Taai la kavaan bhral tââq gani, nek kavaan achêk kah dyơq nek taai paraaq hươq. Bơơi Yaang Pleng ơi đóng ơơn leq Ap-ra-haam tapâng paraaq hươq. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Kơi ađek nek, gani hau ngi đươi? Gani ơi bâân tamót kơơq ơi taai nôôq rau tarnêêng lơt, xong xók bâân đóng tââq nôôq dhơn pleng leq têi ưng mưi nak manưih dhiq m'pơng, đóng patơk n'đó xók akóón chachau bhral, hơq paraaq hươq ơi bâân tavaaih leq akóón chachau achêk. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Bơơi manưih dhiq m'pơng nek kah koom đóng mưi hót, hơq Yaang Pleng nek ve mưi. <verse eid="GAL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Kơi ađek gani vôôiq tapalâh lóóiq paraaq hươq eh lua? Rau ađek nek kah kơi chóóm! Ơi la gani bâân đóng hơq ve chóóm đââng lóóiq parmông, nek alua rau bhơt liêm alua bhral tââq gani. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Bơơi Bha-aar Yaang Pleng ơi król tabhơt dyóp rau raal matu lơt đóng tââq ve lóóm huuiq dhiq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, paraaq hươq ve chóóm bâân đóng leq nôôq manưih ve lóóm huuiq.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Kơi ađek bơơi, xók loom lóóm huuiq achêk tơk, nôôq he biêh bâân takról raal gani, xók bâân takról đóng patơk xók lóóm huuiq bâân tapakah. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Patơk mơ, gani ơi val xar manưih đương lêi ưng nôôq he kanóq tơk Chuôq Paq Manưih, buôn nôôq he ve chóóm bâân đóók bhơt liêm tââq lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Bơơi xong xók lóóm huuiq ơi bhral, nôôq he kah dyơq tơơt raraal manưih đương lêi dyơq. <verse eid="GAL 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Taai tabhơt adhi anó nek akóón ưng Yaang Pleng, đươi lóóm huuiq dhiq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Tââq la ngaai dhơơm ơi đơơp bap-teem kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih nek maar pei xơp Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Kah pantua Jo Thaaiq môôiq Hi-laap, kah pantua têêng xól môôiq rathaai, kah pantua padruuih môôiq pađiil, ơi tabhơt adhi anó nek mưi kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Hơq la adhi anó mađó lơq Chuôq Paq Manưih, hơq adhi anó nek akóón chachau ưng Ap-ra-haam, nek nôôq manưih pâng đơơp ting paraaq hươq.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Bơơi aku kiêng móón kơi đóng patơk ađó mơ manưih đơơp drươp kavaan dyơq xayââr paniên, nek ađó achêk kah rau n'tua mưi nak têêng xól, dhơ nek kala ưng tabhơt drươp kavaan. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Palâh lóóiq ađó achêk tơơt raraal nôôq manưih chamet lêi lơq nôôq manưih gamang đóng patơk ganah ơi xêi loom ưng akonh. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Kung makơi achêk, xók nôôq he dyơq nek akóón paniên, nôôq he bâân têêng xól đóng nôôq dhaniêng tââp tanââp ưng akóón manưih. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Bơơi bhêêl xók ơi xong ganah nil ơi tơk, Yaang Pleng ơi kayua Akóón Ađó, xók n'niên tââq mưi nak pađiil, n'niên raal gani, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />đóng Ađó paq jóói nôôq manưih tơơt raal gani, hơq đóng nôôq he ve chóóm bâân pei đơơp kataai têêng akóón partơơt. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Mat lââng, taai adhi anó nek akóón, hayơq Yaang Pleng ơi kayua Yaang Liêm ưng Akóón Ađó mót leq lóóm nôôq he, dhaloong karơ kơi ađô: “A-ba, Ama.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Taai kơi ađek, adhi anó yươq dyơq nek têêng xól dyơq, bơơi nek akóón, hơq la nek akóón, hơq kung nek manưih đơơp drươp kavaan ganơơm Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Bơơi bhêêl n'loom, xók kah ơi n'nal Yaang Pleng, adhi anó ơi bâân têêng xól đóng nôôq rau dhơơm hơq leq achak araang eh rau nek yaang rauriq. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Dyơq bhêêl ađôk xók ơi lêi n'nal Yaang Pleng, hơq dhalam lơh nek ơi bâân Yaang Pleng n'nal tơk, nek ng'kơi têêng adhi anó val palâh chô palơq nôôq dhaniêng tââp tanââp kah machak lơq kah chóóm đươi, adhi anó rââm kiêng têêng xól đóng piđó kơơq mưi chu dyơq môôiq alua? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Adhi anó dyơq lêi tangêi, kaxe, nil, lơq kamó! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Aku karaang đóng adhi anó, kakhin nek dhakơi aku ơi têêng nhưh nhen kơi kah malơơi malaai dhiq m'pơng adhi anó.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Nhan móón adhi anó, aku nhan adhi anó phaai val xar thê kơi aku, ơi aku kung kơi adhi anó. Adhi anó yươq têêng tamôôp aku m'bưưiq m'bâ. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Adhi anó n'nal kơi tapâng rau ka-ai dhuôr kalóóng achak araang ađô, aku ơi truuih đuui Taruuih Liêm đóng adhi anó jal tââp tarnââp. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Palơq rau klêêu lêi leq adhi anó dhiq talum achak araang aku, adhi anó ơi kah kađiq lơơi, kung yươq kah đươi, palâh lóóiq, adhi anó ơi pơh yaauq aku kơi dhơn pleng ưng Yaang Pleng, kơi Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Kơi achêk nek lóóm bhuui sương achêk ưng adhi anó n'dhiq vaq? Taai aku truuih đuui leq adhi anó kơi, la ve chóóm bâân, adhi anó alua ơi bhalok mat ưng ađêi kliim đóng leq aku. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Kơi ađek nek aku ơi xar manưih brau ưng adhi anó taai praaq rau lalua đóng adhi anó alua? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Nôôq manưih achêk bhơt lóóm palơq adhi anó, eh rau ve karnóq liêm, bơơi piđó kiêng blah n'tua adhi anó gluh, đóng adhi anó bhơt lóóm palơq piđó. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Bơơi đơơp bhơt lóóm dyóp bhêêl đóng rau liêm nek kre, lơq eh rau chapiên xók aku ve mat palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Nôôq akóón ưng aku ơơi, taai nôôq akóón hơq aku phaai đơơp ka-ai luônh ayaai machu dyơq patơk bhêêl Chuôq Paq Manưih bâân xar achak kalóóng nôôq akóón — <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />mat lââng, aku rââm kiêng tơơt đan palơq nôôq akóón n'drươh bhêêl ađôk lơq klóóih dhơ dhariêng bha-ươr, ưng aku taai aku dyơq karnóq hêch leq nôôq akóón.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Nô nôôq manưih kiêng tơơt raal gani, phaai đóng aku n'nal, adhi anó kah tameng xâng gani ha? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Taai ve paraaq xaraq kơi ađô Ap-ra-haam ve bơơr akóón padruuih, mưi nek tââq manưih pađiil têêng xól, lơq mưi nek tââq manưih pađiil đu rathaai. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Dhơ kơi ađek, panong akóón tââq manưih pađiil têêng xól bâân n'niên ting ng'kar m'bech, hayơq panong akóón tââq manưih pađiil rathaai bâân n'niên tââq paraaq hươq. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Nôôq tarnêêng ađô nek bâân móón tơk kơi mưi babi, taai bơơr chanak pađiil achêk nek bơơr raket bóóp. Mưi raket bóóp dhiq bôôl Si-naai, n'niên akóón gluh têêng xól. Ađek nek A-ga. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />A-ga nek bôôl Si-naai dhiq A-ra-bi, lơq makơi palơq kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem xók ađôk, taai kanóón ađek kung palơq akóón anaaq ađêi dyơq têêng xól. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Bơơi Jê-ru-sa-leem dhiq pleng nek rathaai, hơq ađek nek amêêq ưng nôôq he. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Taai ve paraaq xaraq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">“Phaai bhuui marhaal, ơ manưih kah makóón, nek manưih pađiil kah pabhaq;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Phaai yuur papraaq lơq driêu gahơ, ơ manưih yươq ka-ai karuôq taai n'niên akóón;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Taai akóón anaaq ưng manưih pađiil bâân talơơi bơk lơh akóón anaaq ưng manưih pađiil ve kayiik.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Nhan móón adhi anó, thê kơi I-saak, adhi anó nek akóón ưng paraaq hươq. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Dhơ kơi ađek, dhalam kơi xók hanua, panong akóón bâân n'niên ting ng'kar m'bech jarnah chanaaq panong akóón ting Yaang Liêm ng'kơi, nek xók ađôk kung kơi achêk. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Bơơi Bha-aar Yaang Pleng harau praaq? “Phaai chuih manưih pađiil têêng xól lơq akóón ưng ađó. Taai akóón ưng pađiil têêng xól dha kơi e kah bâân ting đơơp drươp kavaan kung palơq akóón ưng manưih pađiil rathaai.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Taai kơi ađek, nhan móón adhi anó, nôôq he eh rau nek akóón ưng manưih pađiil têêng xól, bơơi nek akóón ưng manưih pađiil rathaai.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi pagluh nôôq he đóng bâân rathaai. Kơi ađek hayơq, phaai dyương tamưng lơq óóq đơơp pei geng et têêng xól dyơq.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Nhan phaai chamet lêi, aku, Phaau-lô, praaq đóng adhi anó kơi la adhi anó kơng đơơp iêt ng'kar, nek Chuôq Paq Manưih e kah đââng malơơi rauriq đóng adhi anó ve. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Aku khin praaq majal dyơq palơq dyóp nak đơơp iêt ng'kar kơi ađó achêk ve tarnêêng phaai huuiq jư tabhơt gani. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Ngaai adhi anó kiêng bâân đóók bhơt liêm tââq gani, ơi bâân talơơi tââq Chuôq Paq Manưih; ơi bil tââq phươk liêm. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Leq phơn nôôq he, đươi Yaang Liêm, tââq lóóm huuiq, nôôq he tahươk tahơn đương lêi rau rââm leq rau bhơt liêm. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Taai kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, rau liêm lơh eh rau nek iêt ng'kar môôiq kah iêt ng'kar, hơq nek lóóm huuiq bâân matêêng tapâng lóóm tanhơr. <verse eid="GAL 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Adhi anó biêh đóók mut liêm. Ngaai ơi kajơq adhi anó đóng óóq bâân paraaq dhalam kayua huuiq? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Rau paxuq ađek kah tơk tââq Yaang dhaloong adhi anó! <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />M'bưưiq piêng têêng paxơơk luch garboq amun. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Kalóóng Chuôq aku ve lóóm huuiq mưng leq adhi anó, kơi adhi anó e kah kanóq n'tua kơi. Mat lââng ngaai nak têêng panhok karnóq adhi anó e đơơp tanóóm tóóm, dhơ kah xêi ađó ađek nek ngaai. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Bơơi, nhan móón adhi anó, la kơi aku bhiêk truuih pachóóm pheep iêt ng'kar hơq ng'kơi aku dyơq bâân kóóp róp? La kơi ađek nek rau têêng lơt ơi taai m'baang chatông ơi bâân katiih lơơi aq. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Aku patơk mơ rââm nôôq manưih têêng parơu adhi anó e tư blươt ađêi vaq.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Nhan móón adhi anó, taai adhi anó ơi bâân dhaloong tơk rau rathaai, chapiên nek rau rathaai eh rau đóng đââng lóóiq kapươk đóng lóóm kanóq manưih ti; klóóih dhiq ađek, phaai têêng yaauq palơq xóng ađêi tââq lóóm tanhơr. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Taai tabhơt gani bâân têêng dyóp kalóóng mưi paraaq kayua: “Akóón phaai nh'nhơr manưih đan tóór akóón kơi chênh ađêi.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Dyơq la adhi anó tarjeng tarxeeq lơq tarkap tarđah xóng ađêi, nek phaai hêch lêi, e vaaih adhi anó tarleng xóng ađêi.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Palâh lóóiq aku praaq kơi ađô, phaai jađaang vôôiq ting Yaang Liêm, nek adhi anó dhakơi yươq têêng iêm lóóm nôôq malóóch kiêng ưng manưih ti. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Taai manưih ti malóóch kiêng lơt palơq Yaang Liêm, dyơq Yaang Liêm tarjơl palơq manưih ti. Tââq bơơr hót tarjơl palơq xóng nhiđó, đóng hayơq yươq vaaih chiên la adhi anó kiêng nôôq rau ađôk, nek bhiêk têêng. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Bơơi la adhi anó bâân Yaang Liêm kađââng, nek adhi anó yươq tơơt raraal gani. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng manưih ti nek drêh dróói, piđó nek: tapiing taniêt, kah sek liêm, têêng dhiêt. <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />Bhuôih kabhêi, têêng abhô, gam chróót, tarjeng pađươk, tatrô, grâ jar-ââih, pađuôh, kah makơi lóóm, tamôôp tablah, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />Chriik lêi, ból plơ, cha ơm palơq rau dhơơm makơi nôôq rau papiing, hơq leq nôôq tarnêêng ađek, aku gaam pagat adhi anó, kơi aku ơi gaam pagat n'loom hei, kơi ngaai dhơơm têêng nôôq tarnêêng kơi ađek e kah bâân tơơt katiêk Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="GAL 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Bơơi pale ưng Yaang Liêm nek tanhơr, bhuui marhaal, yươq rauha, đuôh jruôn, matich mahinh, moor dha-iiq, mưi lóóm, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />moor m'pheep, jư ađêi kala, kah ve ađó gani jơl palơq nôôq rau kơi ađek. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Mat lââng, nôôq manưih mađó leq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi teeng đinh lóóm karnóq manưih ti palơq nôôq malóóch lơq n'thaam kiêng dhiq m'baang chatông.<verse eid="GAL 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />La nôôq he mamông ganơơm Yaang Liêm, nek nôôq he kung kiêng jađaang vôôiq ting Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Óóq val kơi parlaach pajơơr xók ơơr môôp lóóm xóng ađêi, chriik lêi xóng ađêi.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Nhan móón adhi anó, la mưi nak bâân lum kalóóng lơt môôp ve rau, hơq adhi anó nek manưih karơ lóóm huuiq phaai klôôq pahei manưih ađek kalóóng lóóm moor dha-iiq, xók tư hêch lêi ađêi kala, óóq vaaih ađêi kung bâân dharơơl galơơk. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Phaai gưi geng haleng đóng xóng ađêi, lơq kơi ađek adhi anó e têêng dyóp gani ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Ơi la ngaai kanóq ađêi nek mưi m'bưưiq têêng gamak, dhiq xók kah nek rauriq, manưih achêk tư galơơk chachââr ađêi. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Bơơi ting nak phaai haliq lêi tarnêêng ađêi, hayơq xók achêk manưih ađek e ve chóóm đóng pajơơr leq ađêi kala, hơq eh rau marchơng palơq mưi ngaai lââng. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Ơi ting nak e gưi geng haleng ưng chênh ađêi kala.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Mat lââng ngaai bâân pachóóm taruuih Yaang Pleng phaai paak blah kalóóng dyóp rau liêm palơq manưih pachóóm ađêi. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Óóq đóng bâân galơơk chachââr. Yaang Pleng kah đơơp ajóóch na. Ơi la palââng chóói haurau nek e xóót rau ađek. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Ngaai chóói đóng manưih ti ađêi e tââq manưih ti xóót rau chêt bil. Dyơq ngaai chóói đóng Yaang Liêm e tââq Yaang Liêm bâân xóót rau parmông taluôn luôn. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Nôôq he óóq chóóm pabôôk nhưh xók têêng rau liêm, taai tơk pâng bhêêl ganah, nôôq he e xóót leh yưưm la yươq dhur lóóm. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók bhêêl nôôq he ve bâân têêng, nek nôôq he kơng têêng rau liêm đóng dyóp ngaai, hơq kre liêm nek đóng nôôq manưih kalóóng parlóng đong lóóm huuiq.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Phaai lêi nôôq chư grươq ng'kơi hơq aku ơi xaraq đóng adhi anó, palơq chênh têi ađêi. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />N'nal mơ manưih kiêng tavaaih kanóq liêm kalóóng manưih ti, piđó chut adhi anó đơơp iêt ng'kar, chapiên đóng piđó yươq phaai bâân kóóp róp leq m'baang chatông ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Ơi patơk mơ chênh nôôq manưih đơơp iêt ng'kar ađek kung kah đơơp jư gani, bơơi piđó kiêng adhi anó đơơp iêt ng'kar đóng piđó ve chóóm laach pajơơr kalóóng manưih ti ưng adhi anó. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Dyơq ting kơi palơq aku, nhan yươq rauriq val vaaih kơi đóng laach pajơơr lơh tââq leq m'baang chatông ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq nôôq he, taai m'baang chatông achêk, manưih hóng katiêk ting kơi palơq aku ơi bâân teeng đinh, lơq aku ting kơi palơq manưih hóng katiêk kung kơi ađek. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Taai eh rau tarnêêng iêt ng'kar nek tarnêêng hau rauriq, kung eh rau tarnêêng kah iêt ng'kar, bơơi tarnêêng ađek nek mưi rau tame. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Lơq la dhơ dhangaai e jađaang vôôiq ting dhanang ađô, nek nhan yươq rauha lơq rau ayô ka-er tơơt dhiq piđó, lơq dhiq dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên ưng Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Tââq ađôk tơk tabhêêl, nhan óóq ngaai têêng parơu panhok leq aku, taai aku dyơq tabóq dhiq achak araang nôôq dham gamuôn ưng Chuôq Jê-su.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Nhan móón adhi anó, nhan ơơn phươk liêm ưng Chuôq nôôq he, Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih tơơt palơq lóóm karnóq adhi anó. A-meen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>